gametitle=Gran Turismo 3 A-Spec [SCPS-15009]

// GT3 lamp / track-light / sun flare performance patch. Same sections and controls as the GT4 version.
// FILE NAME: PCSX2 only loads this if the name is <serial>_<CRC>.pnach. This file is named for SCPS-15009 (see note in chat).
//   Rename the XXXXXXXX part to the CRC PCSX2 shows for your disc (game properties, or the CRC in the emulog on boot).
// Every patch address and original instruction was checked against the decompressed CORE.GT3.
// Address -> file offset in the unpacked image: offset = address - 0x100000 + 0x114.
// Not runtime-tested in PCSX2: enable one section at a time.
//
// ALTERNATIVE GROUPS - enable at most ONE section from each group (members write the same addresses):
//   Flare Cap 4 / 6 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 20 / 24 / 32
//   Flare Distance Cull 25 / 40 / 60 / 80 / 100
//   Flare Glow Large / Medium / Small / Tiny
//   Sun Flare Half / Quarter / Eighth Size / Off
// INDEPENDENT (can be combined with anything): Flare Halo Pass Off, Streak Lights Off.
// "Lamp Flares Off (Max Speed)" makes the caps, culls, glow and halo sections pointless; use it on its own.
// Cull, Glow and Sun sections use 13 words of the 14-word zero padding at 0x0028C148 (right after the last function,
// before a data table) for stub code. They use separate words, so they can be combined with each other.

[Flare Cap 4]
description=Max 4 lamp flares and 4 track-light flares queued per frame (game default 100).
author=Generated from disassembly of CORE.GT3

// Last hex digits are the cap: 0x04 = 4.
patch=1,EE,20199484,extended,28A20004
patch=1,EE,20199E38,extended,28620004

