[Sun Flare Off]
description=Removes the sun flare draw call completely. Do not combine with the other Sun Flare sections.
author=Generated from disassembly of CORE.GT3

// Replaces the "jal 0x00244E00" at 0x0019A298 with a nop (original word: 0C091380).
patch=1,EE,2019A298,extended,00000000

[Streak Lights Off]
description=Turns off the second flare draw function (streak/line-type lights). Independent of the cap, cull and glow sections.
author=Generated from disassembly of CORE.GT3

// Function 0x00244B98 is called from 0x0019A410. Its first instruction becomes "jr ra". The delay slot is also
// nop'd because the original (sd s2,0x60(sp)) would write into the caller's stack before sp is adjusted.
// Original words: 27BDFF50 / FFB20060.
patch=1,EE,20244B98,extended,03E00008
patch=1,EE,20244B9C,extended,00000000

[Lamp Flares Off (Max Speed)]
description=Turns off ALL lamp and track-light flare drawing. Biggest speedup, but lights lose their glow. Use on its own.
author=Generated from disassembly of CORE.GT3

// Function 0x00244990 is called once per queued flare from 0x0019A454 (car lamps) and 0x0019A598 (track lights).
// Its first instruction becomes "jr ra" and its delay slot a nop, so it returns before touching the stack or GS state.
// Original words: 27BDFF50 / 44801000.
patch=1,EE,20244990,extended,03E00008
patch=1,EE,20244994,extended,00000000
